File name: RHUDLOOP.MP
Path description: Rhudaur (excluding alleys)
Path starts: Rhudaur, Town Centre
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Module 1
Level recommendation: 15-25
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountred: dark monk.
Additional information:

To roam this area properly you need to be criminal or worse (villain,
fiend). Also, you need to go to Game Data -> Monsters, and set dark monks
as 'Enemy' (if they aren't already), and check the box 'Non-hostile'. Then
go to Settings -> Combat, and check the option 'Attack all monsters' if it
isn't already checked. These things will enable MegaMud to rest while
there are still monsters in the room (because when you are criminal or
worse dark monks are neutral to you), thus increasing your rate alot.
 
